hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1463","On the authority of Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Al-Muntashir, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Habib bin Salem, on the authority of Al-Numan bin Bashir: The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to recite on the two Eids, and he once said: On the Eid, “Glorify the name of your Lord, the Most High.” The hadith about the cheater has come to you, so if that falls on Friday, recite them.”"
